  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里究竟是什么地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”终成眷属……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 08 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……疼死了。\n搞什么啊，这到底……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}该死，是哪个混蛋！\n突然把人弄进落穴，\n也太阴险了吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}看来，你们已经抵达了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}哦、哦！？\n你这家伙，做好觉悟了吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}前方究竟有什么在等待呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你们可以手牵着手，\n怀着好奇与恐惧迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……啊？\n迈出脚……？\n搞、搞什么！什么意思啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}我说，你们可以迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}来，迈出脚步吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}少在那里摆架子命令人！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}你在那儿等着！\n我马上就过去！\n不许动啊！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞机械语音消失了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}哼，那家伙吓跑了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}敢把我们害成这样，\n非找它好好算账不可……\n等等……咦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:10:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}这里只有我和学长吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}看来是的{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}感觉有生命危险{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 01 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}哦，真巧啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}没问题的！\n就算阴影出现，\n我也会把它揍扁！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}你就放心坐上我这条泥船吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}话说，为什么只有我们两个啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……？\n好像忘了什么……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_315.bf.json:14:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}……算了，也没关系吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
